==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|VL.|*veranum|(tempus) veranum}}, from {{inh|es|la|vēr||spring}}, from earlier {{m|la|*weror}}, from {{inh|es|itc-pro|*wezor}}, from {{inh|es|ine-pro|*wésr̥||spring}}. Compare Portuguese {{m|pt|verão}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/beˈɾano/|lang=es}}

===Noun===
{{es-noun|m}}

# [[summer]]

